              "id": "ec6fe3ce-6112-48ea-8670-a40533d3b88e",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "Online <em><strong>Heidelberg Journal of Religions on the Internet (</strong></em>HJRI) is an international open-access, peer-reviewed academic journal published by the Institute of Religious Studies at the University of Heidelberg. The journal is committed to promoting and (theoretically and methodically) advancing scientific research at the interface between religion and the <a href=\"#/internet\">internet</a>."
